@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
title S06-structured-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: ManagementController" as ctl
participant "svc: ManagementService" as svc
participant "auth: AuthorizationService" as auth
participant "role: Role" as role
participant "repo: Store" as repo
participant "audit: AuditService" as audit
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. setRoleStatus(actor, id, input)
activate ctl
ctl -> svc: 2. roleStatus(actor, id, status)
activate svc
group same local transaction: business + integrity + version + SUCCESS audit
svc -> auth: 3. lock()
activate auth
deactivate auth
note over svc,auth
begin: rbac:role:status + root department
→ captureUpper before mutation
end note
svc -> auth: 4. protectRole(actor, role)
activate auth
deactivate auth
note over svc,role
managed Role.status = status; enable → changedUpper
upper checks latent capability paths even across disabled nodes.
finish flushes → preserveAdministrator → increments GrantVersion
GrantVersion Java Long id maps physical TINYINT, not BIGINT.
end note
alt audit persistence throws
svc -> audit: 5. success(actor, ROLE_STATUS, target)
activate audit
audit -> repo: 6. save(log)
activate repo
repo --> obj: persistence failure; rollback, no business success
deactivate repo
deactivate audit
else persisted in caller transaction
svc -> audit: 7. success(actor, ROLE_STATUS, target)
activate audit
audit -> repo: 8. save(log)
activate repo
deactivate repo
deactivate audit
note over audit
DDD local derives actual actor identity-role snapshot before append.
No independent SUCCESS commit; timestamps have millisecond precision.
end note
end
end
note over svc
Spring interceptor COMMIT after normal method return; failure blocks success response.
end note
note over audit
denied is a separate REQUIRES_NEW DENIED event, not business SUCCESS.
AOP method/log timing is neither audit_log nor proof of DB commit.
end note
deactivate svc
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml